  "_doc": "Tier-2 pharmacy on Route 9 (Pell's Crossing, lot 'pharmacy', front faces the highway). Route: steel shutter down out front -> round the back to the pried loading-bay door -> stockroom ambush among the shelves -> back hall past the locked dispensary -> office: Lydia, the RX key and the ledger -> unlock the dispensary (loot, safe opens with the same key) -> unbolt the dispensary side door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
